
Available Commands:
  :help, :h, ?     Show this help message
  :quit, :q, :exit      Exit the REPL
  :type, :t <expr>  Show the type of an expression
  :load, :l <file>  Load a file into the REPL
  :reset, :r        Reset the REPL state
  :defs, :d       Show all definitions in scope
  :llvm <expr>  Show generated LLVM IR
  :time <expr>  Time expression evaluation

Tips:
  • Define functions: (define (add x y) (+ x y))
  • Type signatures: (:: add (-> Int Int Int))
  • Data types: (data Maybe (a) (Nothing) (Just a))
  • Expressions are evaluated and results shown
  • Use ; for line comments
  • Unbalanced parens continue on the next line; a blank line aborts
  • No history or line editing; Ctrl+D ends the session, Ctrl+C kills it

